text=['# Financial metric glossary — BSE examples','', 'Cutoff14 October2026. Historical figures are consolidated unless stated. cr = INR crore. Source IDs are in the appendix. CALCULATED figures inherit source limitations. Missing histories and peers are explicit, not zero.','']
